          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object label="&lt;b&gt;CLIENT → SERVER — every switch branch, in code order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 start — stt.reset · engine.reset · startConversation&lt;br&gt;2 stop — tts.cancel · endConversation&lt;br&gt;3 audio — base64 → Float32 → RMS → feedAudio + onAudioEnergy&lt;br&gt;4 simulate — setNextTranscript → onCompleteUtterance → pipeline&lt;br&gt;5 interrupt — only while SPEAKING: onAudioEnergy(1.0)&lt;br&gt;6 get_history — undocumented in the protocol block&lt;br&gt;7 default — unknown type; malformed JSON errors earlier at" class="card.invariant" id="card_in">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#E8EAF6;strokeColor=#3F51B5;fontSize=8;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=6;opacity=70;" parent="1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="304" y="488" width="456" height="124" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object label="&lt;b&gt;SERVER → CLIENT — all 6 types and their only emitters&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;state — on every stateChange, and once on connect&lt;br&gt;transcript user assistant&lt;br&gt;tts_chunk — Float32 → Buffer → base64, index/total&lt;br&gt;tts_done interrupted=true interrupted=false&lt;br&gt;history empty on start on get_history&lt;br&gt;error pipeline throw bad JSON unknown type&lt;br&gt;the browser handles exactly these six — voice.js" class="card.primitive" id="card_out">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;fontSize=8;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=6;opacity=70;" parent="1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="792" y="488" width="456" height="124" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object label="&lt;b&gt;MIC AUDIO CANNOT PRODUCE A TRANSCRIPT — the wired path&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 audio feedAudio() buffers the chunk — nothing drains it&lt;br&gt;2 MockSTT.transcribe() speechToText.js — no caller exists&lt;br&gt;3 onEndpointWithTranscript turnManager.js — no caller exists&lt;br&gt;4 partialTranscript is written only by onCompleteUtterance&lt;br&gt;5 endpointDetected therefore carries transcript = &#x27;&#x27;&lt;br&gt;6 server.js returns early on falsy — the turn ends silently&lt;br&gt;mic drives VAD only; only &#x27;simulate&#x27; reaches the engine" class="card.failure" id="card_dead">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFEBEE;strokeColor=#C62828;fontSize=8;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=6;opacity=70;" parent="1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="548" y="636" width="456" height="124" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
